{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c7\u00a0Story\u00a0\u25c7</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventurer Neia is commissioned by the guild to investigate a mysterious tower in the forest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a series of powerful enemies appear one after another...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c7\u00a0Game Systems\u00a0\u25c7</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959930/extras/787748dfd36ea2fa016f726210e2575f.avif?t=1761812393\" width=960 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A third-person, easy-to-learn, classic RPG mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Use the village as your base\u00a0and head to the tower for investigation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Convenient portals get you to your destination in an instant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The map features a simple action-game format to shorten combat time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 With only two options\u2014attack or charged attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 You can save at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c7\u00a0Character\u00a0\u25c7</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Neia Farren</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl who has held a strong admiration for the cosmos since she was a child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She travels the world in search of something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite her appearance, she is a powerful\u00a0and capable adventurer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is skilled in staff combat and wields\u00a0her own unique magic, which she has named Star Magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her thought process is peculiar; she often acts on impulse,\u00a0which frequently confuses those around her,\u00a0though she remains completely unaware of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959930?t=1761812393","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959930/647dd5e8e7b554624279b16b4e208497c7f28cb4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761812393","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959930/8c27ee2f714fcfd594cb2a3bf49d02e685dee3c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761812393","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959930/8c27ee2f714fcfd594cb2a3bf49d02e685dee3c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761812393","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c7\u00a0Story\u00a0\u25c7</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventurer Neia is commissioned by the guild to investigate a mysterious tower in the forest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a series of powerful enemies appear one after another...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c7\u00a0Game Systems\u00a0\u25c7</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959930/extras/787748dfd36ea2fa016f726210e2575f.avif?t=1761812393\" width=960 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A third-person, easy-to-learn, classic RPG mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 Use the village as your base\u00a0and head to the tower for investigation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Convenient portals get you to your destination in an instant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The map features a simple action-game format to shorten combat time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 With only two options\u2014attack or charged attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 You can save at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c7\u00a0Character\u00a0\u25c7</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Neia Farren</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl who has held a strong admiration for the cosmos since she was a child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She travels the world in search of something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite her appearance, she is a powerful\u00a0and capable adventurer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is skilled in staff combat and wields\u00a0her own unique magic, which she has named Star Magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her thought process is peculiar; she often acts on impulse,\u00a0which frequently confuses those around her,\u00a0though she remains completely unaware of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ornament"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959930/c5d37ab383263de61e470ba2d5603652229118ec/header.jpg?t=1761812393","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3959930/872932315/a9c1acff6864cb972b8887fa7a9e8a0941454053/1761648666/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761649824","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3959930/872932315/a9c1acff6864cb972b8887fa7a9e8a0941454053/1761648666/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761649824","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3959930/872932315/a9c1acff6864cb972b8887fa7a9e8a0941454053/1761648666/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761649824","id":257223582,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257223582/movie480.mp4?t=1761649824","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257223582/movie_max.mp4?t=1761649824"},"name":"Star Witch","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati